---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro'
import SectionLabel from '../../components/SectionLabel.astro'
---

<PageLayout
  title="About us"
  description="Globaal Elevate Production grew out of the North Bohemian music scene. Today it brings events, music, marketing and software development under one roof."
  badge="• Who we are"
  heading="We grew out of the scene."
  lead="Before we became a creative group, we were people around music and events in North Bohemia."
  lang="en"
>
  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="asym-grid anim-fade">
        <div>
          <SectionLabel text="Our mission" />
          <p class="meta-text">Since 2026</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-body">
          <h2 class="section-heading">From a real scene to a creative group</h2>
          <p class="body-text">
            Globaal Elevate Production grew out of a real scene, not a spreadsheet. Before we became a creative group, we were people around music and events in North Bohemia. From that background we grew into marketing, software development and our own SaaS products.
          </p>
          <p class="body-text">
            Every brand under us solves a problem we experienced ourselves. We are based in Prague, but our roots are in the north.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="section values-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="anim-fade">
        <SectionLabel text="Our values" />
        <h2 class="section-heading">What drives us</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid anim-stagger">
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-number">01</div>
          <h3>The scene as a foundation</h3>
          <p>We started at music events in North Bohemia. Experience with logistics, promotion and audiences is part of every project we build today.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-number">02</div>
          <h3>Our own problem, our own solution</h3>
          <p>Globaal Production was born because we ourselves had nowhere to order decent branding at a reasonable price. Every one of our brands solves a problem we experienced first-hand.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-number">03</div>
          <h3>Connected, not isolated</h3>
          <p>Events through 3lwave, music through Globaal Records, marketing through Globaal Production, technology through Vision Technology. Every brand can draw on the capacity of the others. A system, not a coincidence.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-number">04</div>
          <h3>Numbers over slogans</h3>
          <p>We don't measure success by follower counts. We measure it in projects that stand — events that sold out, websites that convert, clients who came back.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Leadership -->
  <section class="section management-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="anim-fade">
        <SectionLabel text="Leadership" />
        <h2 class="section-heading">Three founders, one vision</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mgmt-grid anim-stagger">
        <div class="mgmt-card">
          <div class="mgmt-photo">
            <img src="/zakladatel.jpg" alt="Jakub Lučan" class="mgmt-img" onerror="this.parentElement.classList.add('no-photo')" />
            <div class="mgmt-placeholder">JL</div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mgmt-name">Jakub Lučan</h3>
          <p class="mgmt-role">Co-founder & Managing Director · CEO & CTO</p>
          <p class="mgmt-bio">Runs the company and drives the group's technology direction. From internal systems to the architecture of digital products.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mgmt-card">
          <div class="mgmt-photo">
            <img src="/stepan-lisa.jpg" alt="Štěpán Lísa" class="mgmt-img" onerror="this.parentElement.classList.add('no-photo')" />
            <div class="mgmt-placeholder">ŠL</div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mgmt-name">Štěpán Lísa</h3>
          <p class="mgmt-role">Co-founder · Creative Director</p>
          <p class="mgmt-bio">The group's lead graphic designer. Behind the visual identity and branding of GEP and the brands under it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mgmt-card">
          <div class="mgmt-photo">
            <img src="/jan-lestina.jpg" alt="Jan Leština" class="mgmt-img" onerror="this.parentElement.classList.add('no-photo')" />
            <div class="mgmt-placeholder">JL</div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mgmt-name">Jan Leština</h3>
          <p class="mgmt-role">Co-founder · Head of Marketing</p>
          <p class="mgmt-bio">Responsible for marketing and growth. From digital campaigns to brand building.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Brands -->
  <section class="section brands-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="anim-fade">
        <SectionLabel text="Portfolio" />
        <h2 class="section-heading">Our projects</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="brands-list anim-stagger">
        <a href="https://3lwave.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card brand-row">
          <div class="brand-info">
            <span class="brand-tag">Events</span>
            <strong>3lwave</strong>
          </div>
          <p>We organise concerts, club events and tour stops, from Chomutov to other cities across the country.</p>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://3lwave.cz/label" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card brand-row">
          <div class="brand-info">
            <span class="brand-tag">Music</span>
            <strong>Globaal Records</strong>
          </div>
          <p>An independent music label. We look for authentic artists and help them with releases, distribution and development.</p>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio" class="card brand-row">
          <div class="brand-info">
            <span class="brand-tag">Creative</span>
            <strong>Globaal Production</strong>
          </div>
          <p>A creative and marketing agency for small and medium-sized businesses. Websites, branding and online advertising that bring in customers.</p>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://visiontechnology.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card brand-row">
          <div class="brand-info">
            <span class="brand-tag">Technology</span>
            <strong>Vision Technology</strong>
          </div>
          <p>Custom software: AI systems, web applications and our own SaaS products.</p>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .section-heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .meta-text {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .body-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .mission-body {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .values-section {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  /* Values: editorial grid-with-rules — lighter than clickable portfolio cards */
  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .value-item {
    padding: 2rem 2rem 2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .value-item:nth-child(odd) {
    padding-right: 3rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .value-item:nth-child(even) {
    padding-left: 3rem;
    padding-right: 0;
  }

  .value-number {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .value-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .value-item p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .management-section { background: var(--bg); }

  .mgmt-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .mgmt-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }

  .mgmt-photo {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .mgmt-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    display: block;
  }

  .mgmt-placeholder {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .mgmt-photo.no-photo .mgmt-img { display: none; }
  .mgmt-photo.no-photo .mgmt-placeholder { display: flex; }

  .mgmt-name { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .mgmt-role {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .mgmt-bio { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.65; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mgmt-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .mgmt-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .mgmt-photo { max-width: 200px; }
  }

  .brands-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .brand-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .brand-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .brand-tag {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .brand-info strong {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .brand-row p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .arrow {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .brand-row:hover .arrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .value-item:nth-child(odd) {
      border-right: none;
      padding-right: 0;
    }

    .value-item:nth-child(even) {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .brand-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    }

    .brand-row p {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
